flowchart TB
  Host[平台组合根<br/>打开资料库并注入端口] --> App[AgentApplicationRuntime<br/>应用命令、启动恢复与任务所有权]
  UI[展示模型 / 窗口] -->|命令与查询| App
  App -->|合并的状态通知| UI
  App --> Modules[RuntimeModuleHost<br/>应用作用域与模块激活]
  Modules --> Registry[类型化能力注册表]
  Registry -->|冻结代次与租约| Catalog[AgentRuntimeCatalog]
  App -->|原子接纳| Session[SessionRuntime<br/>每会话命令通道]
  Session --> Journal[SessionJournal / SessionPayloadStore<br/>日志与内联／外置正文]
  App -->|持有任务| Kernel[AgentExecutionKernel]
  Catalog --> Kernel
  Kernel --> Driver[精确版本的 AgentDriver]
  Kernel --> Executors[模型与工具执行器]
  Kernel --> Finalizer[唯一终态结算]
  Executors --> Session
  Finalizer --> Session
  App --> Recovery[AgentExecutionRecovery<br/>只核对与中断结算]
  Recovery --> Session
  Executors --> Business[业务事务 / 来源授权端口]
  Recovery --> Business
